OL,5,G2100 My Ireland Too
OL,6,     FSet in Cork, this powerful
OL,7,     Fdocumentary series follows young
OL,8,     Fasylum seekers and migrants as
OL,9,     Fthey navigate a world of rising
OL,10,     Fhostility.
OL,11,G2200 The Tonight Show
OL,12,     FComment and analysis on the big
OL,13,     Fstories of the day in Ireland and
OL,14,     Fabroad with a panel of guests
OL,15,     Fcovering the key issues.
OL,16,G2300 The Hotel Inspector
OL,17,     FHotel Inspector Alex Polizzi sets
OL,18,     Fout on a mission to transform the
OL,19,     Ffortunes of hotels and guest
OL,20,     Fhouses.
